{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も｢真夏の全国ツアー2015｣が、5日から始まりましたヽ(^o^)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に初日の仙台を迎えることができ、良いスタートが切れたんじゃないかなと私は思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブでは、見所がたくさんあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレになっちゃうから詳しくは言えないけど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつだけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎公演、一回、永島聖羅から、必ず、キスをされるということ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/08/07/1743860/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女が永島さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ほっぺにね♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台公演で気付いた方もいるかと思いますが、実は去年のライブからやられてますヽ(´ー｀)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこで彼女が仕掛けてくるかは分かりませんが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応これも見所ということで、ツアーに来られる皆さん、是非探してみてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/08/07/1743860/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の名古屋個別でも浴衣を着ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は花火大会シーズン？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたい(；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれだけです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また(^_^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/08/07/174386